-- Food and Nutrition Act of 2008 (7 U.S.C. ch. 51), section 2027: appropriations and allotments (snap2).
-- SOURCE: usc07-ch51.txt, a converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text; nothing here is verified against it.
-- JUST TRUE: the text says yes. JUST FALSE: the text says no in its own words. NOTHING: the text does not say.
-- Money is a NUMBER of dollars. Fiscal years are numbers (the 2027 fiscal year is 2027). "One-fourth of 1 per centum" is 1 divided by 400.

§ `Section 2027(a): authorization of allotments, restriction on use of funds, nutrition education`

-- src:2700 | (1) To carry out this chapter, there are authorized to be appropriated such sums as are necessary for each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023. Not to exceed one-fourth of 1 per centum of the previous year’s appropriation is authorized in each such fiscal year to carry out the provisions of section 2026 of this title, subject to paragraph (3).
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(a)(1) (src:2700-2700)
GIVEN `the fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(a)(1) sums are authorized to be appropriated for the fiscal year` MEANS
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023"; the text says nothing of any other year
    IF `the fiscal year` AT LEAST 2008 AND `the fiscal year` AT MOST 2023 THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:2700 | (1) To carry out this chapter, there are authorized to be appropriated such sums as are necessary for each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023. Not to exceed one-fourth of 1 per centum of the previous year’s appropriation is authorized in each such fiscal year to carry out the provisions of section 2026 of this title, subject to paragraph (3).
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(a)(1) (src:2700-2700)
GIVEN `the fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `the previous year's appropriation` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2027(a)(1) the most that is authorized in the fiscal year to carry out section 2026` MEANS
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in each such fiscal year", that is each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023
    IF `the fiscal year` AT LEAST 2008 AND `the fiscal year` AT MOST 2023 THEN JUST (`the previous year's appropriation` DIVIDED BY 400) ELSE NOTHING

-- src:2700 | (1) To carry out this chapter, there are authorized to be appropriated such sums as are necessary for each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023. Not to exceed one-fourth of 1 per centum of the previous year’s appropriation is authorized in each such fiscal year to carry out the provisions of section 2026 of this title, subject to paragraph (3).
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(a)(1) (src:2700-2700)
GIVEN `the fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `the previous year's appropriation` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount appropriated in the fiscal year to carry out section 2026` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(a)(1) the amount for section 2026 is within what is authorized` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in each such fiscal year", that is each of fiscal years 2008 through 2023
        IF `the fiscal year` LESS THAN 2008 OR `the fiscal year` GREATER THAN 2023 THEN NOTHING
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Not to exceed one-fourth of 1 per centum of the previous year’s appropriation is authorized"
        IF `the amount appropriated in the fiscal year to carry out section 2026` GREATER THAN `the previous year's appropriation` DIVIDED BY 400 THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:2701 | (2) No funds authorized to be appropriated under this chapter or any other Act of Congress shall be used by any person, firm, corporation, group, or organization at any time, directly or indirectly, to interfere with or impede the implementation of any provision of this chapter or any rule, regulation, or project thereunder, except that this limitation shall not apply to the provision of legal and related assistance in connection with any proceeding or action before any State or Federal agency or court. The President shall ensure that this paragraph is complied with by such order or other means as the President deems appropriate.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(a)(2) (src:2701-2701)
GIVEN `the use of the funds is to interfere with or impede the implementation of any provision of this chapter or of any rule, regulation, or project under it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the use is the provision of legal and related assistance in connection with a proceeding or action before a State or Federal agency or court` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(a)(2) the limitation on the use of funds bars the use` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "except that this limitation shall not apply to the provision of legal and related assistance in connection with any proceeding or action before any State or Federal agency or court"
        IF `the use is the provision of legal and related assistance in connection with a proceeding or action before a State or Federal agency or court` THEN JUST FALSE
        IF `the use of the funds is to interfere with or impede the implementation of any provision of this chapter or of any rule, regulation, or project under it` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to interfere with or impede the implementation"; a use for another purpose is not addressed
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2701 | (2) No funds authorized to be appropriated under this chapter or any other Act of Congress shall be used by any person, firm, corporation, group, or organization at any time, directly or indirectly, to interfere with or impede the implementation of any provision of this chapter or any rule, regulation, or project thereunder, except that this limitation shall not apply to the provision of legal and related assistance in connection with any proceeding or action before any State or Federal agency or court. The President shall ensure that this paragraph is complied with by such order or other means as the President deems appropriate.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(a)(2) (src:2701-2701)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(a)(2) the President is required to ensure that paragraph (2) is complied with` MEANS
    -- "The President shall ensure that this paragraph is complied with by such order or other means as the President deems appropriate": no condition; the means are the President's to choose
    JUST TRUE

-- src:2703 | (A) Of the amounts made available under the second sentence of paragraph (1), not more than $2,000,000 in any fiscal year may be used by the Secretary to make 2-year competitive grants that will—
-- src:2704 | (i) enhance interagency cooperation in nutrition education activities; and
-- src:2705 | (ii) develop cost effective ways to inform people eligible for supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits about nutrition, resource management, and community nutrition education programs, such as the expanded food and nutrition education program.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(a)(3)(A) (src:2703-2705)
GIVEN `the amount used in the fiscal year to make the grants` IS A NUMBER
      `the grants are 2-year competitive grants` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the grants will enhance interagency cooperation in nutrition education activities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the grants will develop cost effective ways to inform people eligible for benefits about nutrition, resource management, and community nutrition education programs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(a)(3)(A) the Secretary may use the amount for the grants` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "2-year competitive grants that will— (i) enhance interagency cooperation in nutrition education activities; and (ii) develop cost effective ways to inform people"; other grants are not addressed
        IF NOT (`the grants are 2-year competitive grants` AND `the grants will enhance interagency cooperation in nutrition education activities` AND `the grants will develop cost effective ways to inform people eligible for benefits about nutrition, resource management, and community nutrition education programs`) THEN NOTHING
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "not more than $2,000,000 in any fiscal year may be used by the Secretary"
        IF `the amount used in the fiscal year to make the grants` GREATER THAN 2000000 THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

