    IF `the Secretary is prescribing the manner in which allotments will be reduced` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

§ `Section 2027(d): the Secretary's action to reduce allotments, and the statement to the Committees`

DECLARE `s 2027(d) action` IS ONE OF
    `s 2027(d) take the requisite action to reduce allotments`
    `s 2027(d) furnish the Committees a statement`

-- src:2714 | Not later than sixty days after the issuance of a report under subsection (a) of this section in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions in the value of allotments to be issued to households certified to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program will be necessary, the Secretary shall take the requisite action to reduce allotments in accordance with the requirements of this section. Not later than seven days after the Secretary takes any action to reduce allotments under this section, the Secretary shall furnish the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate a statement setting forth (1) the basis of the Secretary’s determination, (2) the manner in which the allotments will be reduced, and (3) the action that has been taken by the Secretary to reduce the allotments.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(d) (src:2714-2714)
GIVEN `a report under subsection (a) was issued in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions in the value of allotments will be necessary` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(d) the Secretary is required to take the requisite action to reduce allotments` MEANS
    -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): "the issuance of a report under subsection (a)": subsection (a) as rendered here contains no report; its heading alone mentions "monthly reports of expenditures". The report is taken as a fact the caller states
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty runs from "the issuance of a report ... in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions ... will be necessary"
    IF `a report under subsection (a) was issued in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions in the value of allotments will be necessary` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:2714 | Not later than sixty days after the issuance of a report under subsection (a) of this section in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions in the value of allotments to be issued to households certified to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program will be necessary, the Secretary shall take the requisite action to reduce allotments in accordance with the requirements of this section. Not later than seven days after the Secretary takes any action to reduce allotments under this section, the Secretary shall furnish the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate a statement setting forth (1) the basis of the Secretary’s determination, (2) the manner in which the allotments will be reduced, and (3) the action that has been taken by the Secretary to reduce the allotments.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(d) (src:2714-2714)
GIVEN `the date of the issuance of the report` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 2027(d) the last day for the requisite action` MEANS
    -- "Not later than sixty days after the issuance of a report"
    `the date of the issuance of the report` PLUS 60

-- src:2714 | Not later than sixty days after the issuance of a report under subsection (a) of this section in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions in the value of allotments to be issued to households certified to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program will be necessary, the Secretary shall take the requisite action to reduce allotments in accordance with the requirements of this section. Not later than seven days after the Secretary takes any action to reduce allotments under this section, the Secretary shall furnish the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate a statement setting forth (1) the basis of the Secretary’s determination, (2) the manner in which the allotments will be reduced, and (3) the action that has been taken by the Secretary to reduce the allotments.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(d) (src:2714-2714)
GIVEN `the date of the issuance of the report` IS A DATE
      `the date of the Secretary's action` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(d) the action was taken in time` MEANS
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Not later than sixty days after the issuance of a report" (a later action is not within the time)
    -- NOTHING-kind (silent): an action before the report is not addressed
    BRANCH
        IF `the date of the Secretary's action` LESS THAN `the date of the issuance of the report` THEN NOTHING
        IF `the date of the Secretary's action` AT MOST `s 2027(d) the last day for the requisite action` `the date of the issuance of the report` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2714 | Not later than sixty days after the issuance of a report under subsection (a) of this section in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions in the value of allotments to be issued to households certified to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program will be necessary, the Secretary shall take the requisite action to reduce allotments in accordance with the requirements of this section. Not later than seven days after the Secretary takes any action to reduce allotments under this section, the Secretary shall furnish the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate a statement setting forth (1) the basis of the Secretary’s determination, (2) the manner in which the allotments will be reduced, and (3) the action that has been taken by the Secretary to reduce the allotments.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(d) (src:2714-2714)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 2027(d) action`
`s 2027(d) the Secretary must take the requisite action within sixty days of the report` MEANS
    PARTY `the Secretary`
    MUST `s 2027(d) take the requisite action to reduce allotments`
    WITHIN 60
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Secretary` BECAUSE "the requisite action to reduce allotments was not taken within sixty days after the report"

