@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(d) (src:2714-2714)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 2027(d) action`
`s 2027(d) the Secretary must furnish the Committees a statement within seven days of the action` MEANS
    PARTY `the Secretary`
    MUST `s 2027(d) furnish the Committees a statement`
    WITHIN 7
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Secretary` BECAUSE "the statement was not furnished to the Committees within seven days after the action"

-- src:2714 | Not later than sixty days after the issuance of a report under subsection (a) of this section in which the Secretary expresses the belief that reductions in the value of allotments to be issued to households certified to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program will be necessary, the Secretary shall take the requisite action to reduce allotments in accordance with the requirements of this section. Not later than seven days after the Secretary takes any action to reduce allotments under this section, the Secretary shall furnish the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate a statement setting forth (1) the basis of the Secretary’s determination, (2) the manner in which the allotments will be reduced, and (3) the action that has been taken by the Secretary to reduce the allotments.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(d) (src:2714-2714)
GIVEN `the statement sets forth the basis of the Secretary's determination` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement sets forth the manner in which the allotments will be reduced` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement sets forth the action that has been taken by the Secretary to reduce the allotments` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(d) the statement sets forth what the subsection requires` MEANS
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "a statement setting forth (1) the basis of the Secretary’s determination, (2) the manner in which the allotments will be reduced, and (3) the action that has been taken" (a statement lacking one of the three does not set forth all)
    IF `the statement sets forth the basis of the Secretary's determination` AND `the statement sets forth the manner in which the allotments will be reduced` AND `the statement sets forth the action that has been taken by the Secretary to reduce the allotments` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE

§ `Section 2027(e) and (f): funds collected from claims, and transfers`

-- src:2716 | Funds collected from claims against households or State agencies, including claims collected pursuant to section 2016(f) [Footnote: 1 See References in Text note below.] of this title, subsections (g) and (h) of section 2020 of this title, subsections (b) and (c) of section 2022 of this title, and section 2025(c)(1) of this title, claims resulting from resolution of audit findings, and claims collected from households receiving overissuances, shall be credited to the supplemental nutrition assistance program appropriation account for the fiscal year in which the collection occurs. Funds provided to State agencies under section 2025(c) of this title shall be paid from the appropriation account for the fiscal year in which the funds are provided.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(e) (src:2716-2716)
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(e) the claim is against a household or a State agency` MEANS
    -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "Funds collected from claims against households or State agencies, including claims collected pursuant to ..." ; a claim against any other party is not addressed
    CONSIDER claim's `owed by`
    WHEN `the household` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `a household member` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `an applicant household` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `the State agency` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `the Secretary` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `a tribal organization` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `a benefit issuer` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `a retail food store` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `a wholesale food concern` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `a sponsor of an alien` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `a court` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `an administrative agency` THEN NOTHING

-- src:2716 | Funds collected from claims against households or State agencies, including claims collected pursuant to section 2016(f) [Footnote: 1 See References in Text note below.] of this title, subsections (g) and (h) of section 2020 of this title, subsections (b) and (c) of section 2022 of this title, and section 2025(c)(1) of this title, claims resulting from resolution of audit findings, and claims collected from households receiving overissuances, shall be credited to the supplemental nutrition assistance program appropriation account for the fiscal year in which the collection occurs. Funds provided to State agencies under section 2025(c) of this title shall be paid from the appropriation account for the fiscal year in which the funds are provided.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(e) (src:2716-2716)
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
      `the fiscal year in which the collection occurs` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2027(e) the fiscal year of the supplemental nutrition assistance program appropriation account to which the funds collected on the claim are credited` MEANS
    -- "shall be credited to the supplemental nutrition assistance program appropriation account for the fiscal year in which the collection occurs"
    -- NOTHING-kind (includes): a claim against a party other than a household or a State agency is not addressed
    CONSIDER `s 2027(e) the claim is against a household or a State agency` claim
    WHEN JUST x THEN IF x THEN JUST `the fiscal year in which the collection occurs` ELSE NOTHING
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- src:2716 | Funds collected from claims against households or State agencies, including claims collected pursuant to section 2016(f) [Footnote: 1 See References in Text note below.] of this title, subsections (g) and (h) of section 2020 of this title, subsections (b) and (c) of section 2022 of this title, and section 2025(c)(1) of this title, claims resulting from resolution of audit findings, and claims collected from households receiving overissuances, shall be credited to the supplemental nutrition assistance program appropriation account for the fiscal year in which the collection occurs. Funds provided to State agencies under section 2025(c) of this title shall be paid from the appropriation account for the fiscal year in which the funds are provided.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(e) (src:2716-2716)
GIVEN `the funds are provided to State agencies under section 2025(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fiscal year in which the funds are provided` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2027(e) the fiscal year of the appropriation account from which the funds provided to State agencies are paid` MEANS
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Funds provided to State agencies under section 2025(c) of this title"
    IF `the funds are provided to State agencies under section 2025(c)` THEN JUST `the fiscal year in which the funds are provided` ELSE NOTHING

DECLARE `s 2027(f) recipient` IS ONE OF
    `s 2027(f) the Office of the Inspector General of the Department of Agriculture`
    `s 2027(f) the Office of the General Counsel of the Department of Agriculture`
    `s 2027(f) any other recipient`

-- src:2718 | No funds appropriated to carry out this chapter may be transferred to the Office of the Inspector General, or the Office of the General Counsel, of the Department of Agriculture.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(f) (src:2718-2718)
GIVEN `the funds were appropriated to carry out this chapter` IS A BOOLEAN
      recipient IS A `s 2027(f) recipient`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(f) the funds may be transferred to the recipient` MEANS
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "No funds appropriated to carry out this chapter may be transferred to the Office of the Inspector General, or the Office of the General Counsel, of the Department of Agriculture"
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): funds not appropriated to carry out this chapter, or a transfer to another recipient, are not addressed
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the funds were appropriated to carry out this chapter` THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE CONSIDER recipient
            WHEN `s 2027(f) the Office of the Inspector General of the Department of Agriculture` THEN JUST FALSE
            WHEN `s 2027(f) the Office of the General Counsel of the Department of Agriculture` THEN JUST FALSE
            WHEN `s 2027(f) any other recipient` THEN NOTHING

§ `Section 2027(g) and (h): bans on recruitment and promotion`

DECLARE `s 2027(g)(1) activity` IS ONE OF
    `s 2027(g)(1)(A) recruitment activities designed to persuade an individual to apply for benefits`
    `s 2027(g)(1)(B) television, radio, or billboard advertisements designed to promote benefits and enrollment`
    `s 2027(g)(1)(C) agreements with foreign governments designed to promote benefits and enrollment`
    `s 2027(g)(1) any other activity`

-- src:2720 | (1) In general
-- src:2721 | Except as provided in paragraph (2), no funds authorized to be appropriated under this chapter shall be used by the Secretary for—
-- src:2722 | (A) recruitment activities designed to persuade an individual to apply for supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits;
-- src:2723 | (B) television, radio, or billboard advertisements that are designed to promote supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits and enrollment; or
-- src:2724 | (C) any agreements with foreign governments designed to promote supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits and enrollment.
-- src:2725 | (2) Limitation
-- src:2726 | Paragraph (1)(B) shall not apply to programmatic activities undertaken with respect to benefits made under section 2014(h) of this title.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(g) (src:2720-2726)
GIVEN activity IS A `s 2027(g)(1) activity`
      `the funds are authorized to be appropriated under this chapter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the funds are used by the Secretary` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the activity is a programmatic activity undertaken with respect to benefits made under section 2014(h)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(g) the ban bars the use of the funds for the activity` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "no funds authorized to be appropriated under this chapter shall be used by the Secretary for": other funds, or use by someone else, are not addressed
        IF NOT (`the funds are authorized to be appropriated under this chapter` AND `the funds are used by the Secretary`) THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE CONSIDER activity
            WHEN `s 2027(g)(1)(A) recruitment activities designed to persuade an individual to apply for benefits` THEN JUST TRUE
            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Paragraph (1)(B) shall not apply to programmatic activities undertaken with respect to benefits made under section 2014(h) of this title"
            WHEN `s 2027(g)(1)(B) television, radio, or billboard advertisements designed to promote benefits and enrollment` THEN IF `the activity is a programmatic activity undertaken with respect to benefits made under section 2014(h)` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE JUST TRUE
            WHEN `s 2027(g)(1)(C) agreements with foreign governments designed to promote benefits and enrollment` THEN JUST TRUE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for— (A) recruitment activities ...; (B) television, radio, or billboard advertisements ...; or (C) any agreements with foreign governments"
            WHEN `s 2027(g)(1) any other activity` THEN NOTHING

-- src:2728 | The Secretary shall issue regulations that prohibit entities that receive funds under this chapter to compensate any person for conducting outreach activities relating to participation in, or for recruiting individuals to apply to receive benefits under, the supplemental nutrition assistance program, if the amount of the compensation would be based on the number of individuals who apply to receive the benefits.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(h) (src:2728-2728)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(h) the Secretary is required to issue the regulations` MEANS
    -- "The Secretary shall issue regulations": no condition; the text gives no time
    JUST TRUE

-- src:2728 | The Secretary shall issue regulations that prohibit entities that receive funds under this chapter to compensate any person for conducting outreach activities relating to participation in, or for recruiting individuals to apply to receive benefits under, the supplemental nutrition assistance program, if the amount of the compensation would be based on the number of individuals who apply to receive the benefits.
@ref 7 U.S.C. 2027(h) (src:2728-2728)
GIVEN `the entity receives funds under this chapter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the compensation is for conducting outreach activities relating to participation in the program, or for recruiting individuals to apply to receive benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amount of the compensation would be based on the number of individuals who apply to receive the benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2027(h) the regulations are to prohibit the entity from compensating the person` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "entities that receive funds under this chapter"
        IF NOT `the entity receives funds under this chapter` THEN NOTHING
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to compensate any person for conducting outreach activities relating to participation in, or for recruiting individuals to apply to receive benefits under, the supplemental nutrition assistance program"
        IF NOT `the compensation is for conducting outreach activities relating to participation in the program, or for recruiting individuals to apply to receive benefits` THEN NOTHING
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if the amount of the compensation would be based on the number of individuals who apply to receive the benefits" (reading (a): a failed "if")
        IF NOT `the amount of the compensation would be based on the number of individuals who apply to receive the benefits` THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
